      "consequence_of_miss": "No judicial probable-cause finding authorizing removal to continue beyond 5 business days; if the court finds continued removal is not appropriate the child must be returned immediately (Mont. Code Ann. § 41-3-306(1)(a), (6)). No hearing is required if the child is released prior to the time of the required hearing (§ 41-3-306(1)(c))"
